---
// Multi-head latent attention (DeepSeek-V3): cache a small latent, rebuild K and V from it.
---
<svg viewBox="0 0 720 332" role="img" aria-label="Multi-head latent attention: the hidden state of 7,168 numbers is compressed to a latent of 512 numbers plus a position key of 64 numbers. Only these 576 numbers are cached. Keys and values for 128 heads are rebuilt from the latent when needed.">
  <defs>
    <marker id="mla-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" class="fill-a" /></marker>
  </defs>
  <!-- hidden -->
  <rect x="16" y="110" width="120" height="110" rx="10" class="box" />
  <text x="76" y="140" class="t" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">Hidden state</text>
  <text x="76" y="160" class="t2" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">of one token</text>
  <text x="76" y="190" class="ta mono" font-size="15" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">7,168</text>
  <text x="76" y="207" class="t3" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle">numbers</text>

  <!-- down projections -->
  <path d="M136 140 H206" class="line-a" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#mla-arrow)" />
  <text x="171" y="132" class="t3 mono" font-size="9.5" text-anchor="middle">compress</text>
  <path d="M136 200 H206" class="line-a" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#mla-arrow)" />
  <text x="171" y="192" class="t3 mono" font-size="9.5" text-anchor="middle">+ RoPE</text>

  <!-- cached box -->
  <rect x="210" y="70" width="190" height="190" rx="12" class="green" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
  <text x="305" y="92" class="tg mono" font-size="10.5" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">STORED IN THE KV CACHE</text>
  <rect x="226" y="112" width="158" height="46" rx="8" class="box-a" />
  <text x="305" y="132" class="t" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">latent c</text>
  <text x="305" y="149" class="ta mono" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">512 numbers</text>
  <rect x="226" y="176" width="158" height="46" rx="8" class="violet" />
  <text x="305" y="196" class="t" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">position key</text>
  <text x="305" y="213" class="tv mono" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">64 numbers</text>
  <text x="305" y="248" class="t" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">576 numbers per layer</text>

  <!-- up projections -->
  <path d="M400 135 C 440 135, 440 90, 478 90" class="line-a" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#mla-arrow)" />
  <path d="M400 135 C 440 135, 440 180, 478 180" class="line-a" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#mla-arrow)" />
  <text x="438" y="76" class="t3 mono" font-size="9.5" text-anchor="middle">expand</text>

  <rect x="482" y="60" width="222" height="60" rx="10" class="box" stroke-dasharray="4 3" />
  <text x="593" y="84" class="t" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">Keys for 128 heads</text>
  <text x="593" y="104" class="t2 mono" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle">128 × 128 (+ shared 64 RoPE)</text>
  <rect x="482" y="150" width="222" height="60" rx="10" class="box" stroke-dasharray="4 3" />
  <text x="593" y="174" class="t" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">Values for 128 heads</text>
  <text x="593" y="194" class="t2 mono" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle">128 × 128</text>
  <text x="593" y="236" class="t3" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">not stored: rebuilt from the latent,</text>
  <text x="593" y="252" class="t3" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">or folded into the query (see Deep dive)</text>

  <!-- compare -->
  <rect x="16" y="274" width="688" height="48" rx="8" class="box2" />
  <text x="30" y="294" class="t2" font-size="12">Normal MHA with 128 heads would store <tspan class="t mono" font-weight="700">128 × (192 + 128) = 40,960</tspan> numbers per layer.</text>
  <text x="30" y="313" class="t2" font-size="12">MLA stores <tspan class="ta mono" font-weight="700">576</tspan>: about 71 × less.</text>
</svg>
